---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = new Date('2026-05-25');
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — stonemegan.dev"
  description="Privacy policy for stonemegan.dev — what data we collect, third-party services, your rights."
>
  <div class="static-page">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><small>Last updated: {lastUpdated.toISOString().slice(0, 10)}</small></p>

  <p>
    This is a personal blog. We collect the minimum data needed to operate it
    and understand which posts are useful. This page is a plain-language summary
    of what is collected and by whom.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect directly</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing directly. There is no signup form, no comments, no account. If you
    email us via the address on the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>, we
    receive your email and message; we don't share it.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party services on this site</h2>

  <h3>Cloudflare</h3>
  <p>
    This site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may log standard request
    data (IP address, user agent, request path) as part of its DDoS protection
    and CDN service. See
    <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h3>Cloudflare Web Analytics</h3>
  <p>
    We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which is privacy-friendly and does not use
    cookies or track individuals across sites. It records aggregate page views,
    referrers, and country. See
    <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a>.
  </p>

  <h3>Plausible Analytics</h3>
  <p>
    We may also use Plausible, a cookie-less analytics service that does not
    collect personal data. See
    <a href="https://plausible.io/privacy" rel="noopener">Plausible privacy policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h3>Google AdSense</h3>
  <p>
    Once we are approved, this site may serve ads via Google AdSense. Google
    and its partners use cookies and similar technologies to serve ads based on
    your prior visits to this and other sites. You can opt out of personalized
    advertising by visiting
    <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener">Google Ad Settings</a>.
    You may also opt out of third-party vendor use of cookies at
    <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.
  </p>

  <h3>Affiliate links</h3>
  <p>
    Some links on this site are affiliate links (Amazon Associates and similar).
    Clicking these may set a cookie from the partner site that attributes a
    later purchase to us. See the partner's privacy policy for details.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies on this site</h2>
  <p>
    The base site sets no cookies. Cookies may be set by AdSense or affiliate
    partners once those are enabled. There is no cookie banner because the site
    itself sets none.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Under GDPR / UK GDPR / Australia Privacy Act, you have the right to ask
    what data we hold about you and to request deletion. Since we don't store
    user accounts, there is typically nothing to delete from our end. For
    third-party services listed above, see their policies for opt-out and
    deletion procedures.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    This site is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect
    information from children.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions or requests: see the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
  </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
